              <zone h='97916' id='1' name='Forecast' w='73418' x='25996' y='1042'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='97916' id='7' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='25410' x='586' y='1042'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='93490' id='8' type-v2='text' w='25410' x='586' y='1042'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000'>Average Monthly Forecast</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='7'>The average monthly future forecast was achieved by factoring in projected percentage change in expenditures per category.  They include the following:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000'>Non Discretionary</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='7'>1 -  Zero attorney fees in the future!  Litigation is complete.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='7'>2 -  Child Care category reduced by 50% because client&apos;s ex-husband will be paying half. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='7'>3 - The cost of gas in the future is a wild card because of global political turmoil.  For the future, worked with client and will forecast a 40% rise in fuel costs.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000'>Discretionary (Client agreed to the following reductions)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='7'>1 - Shopping by 25%.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='7'>2 - Eating Out by 25%</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='7'>3 - Entertainment by 5%</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000'>The future is bright!</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='7'>Note that projected future average monthly spending of $2.751.60 is  down $2,464.44 from the historical average of $5,216.04.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff0000'> That&apos;s a 47% decrease!</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='9500' id='6' name='Forecast' pane-specification-id='5' param='[federated.1sqhiwr0fjjb3r11z8db60tl0tg1].[none:data_type:nk]' type-v2='color' w='14000' x='59000' y='2375' />
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7250' id='9' type-v2='text' w='11000' x='88800' y='1250'>
